{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1216598-celestial-and-solar-circle-spells-for-strategic-maneuvers","id":1216598,"title":"Celestial and Solar Circle Spells for Strategic Maneuvers","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-05-08T06:10:10-07:00","id":1216598,"title":"Celestial and Solar Circle Spells for Strategic Maneuvers","content":"Robert Vance confirmed that some spells, such as those that alter the landscape on a large enough scale, could assist or enhance the results (or success) of certain Strategic Maneuvers, such as Fortification.<br /> <br /> Any ideas what spells Lunars and Solars are using to counter Ramparts of the Obedient Earth?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-08T06:20:52-07:00","id":1216601,"title":"","content":"Dunno? Summon Princes of the Fallen Tower, constant bombardments by that phoenix artillery spell, using that ship spell combined with the spell that summons a giant flying spirit to fly over, maybe summon Octavian to knock it down, use parting of the seas to break through....<br /> <br /> Those kind of stuff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-08T07:03:44-07:00","id":1216622,"title":"","content":"Incantation of the Invincible Army, perhaps?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-08T07:07:49-07:00","id":1216624,"title":"","content":"What about a spell which manipulates the water underneath the earth, causing the massive underground lakes to swell, sending water cascading through mazes of tunnels just below the surface. This in turn could create giant sinkholes which could drastically alter the make-up of any given battlefield.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Co-Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.twitter.com/deliberativepod\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a>!<br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/thedeliberativepodcast\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook</a>!<br /> Follow us on the <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com\" target=\"_blank\">Web</a>!<br /> Like what we do? Support us on <a href=\"http://patreon.com/thedeliberative\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4164-lukkychukky","name":"Lukkychukky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-08T07:24:44-07:00","id":1216634,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lukkychukky</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1216598-celestial-and-solar-circle-spells-for-strategic-maneuvers?p=1216624#post1216624\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What about a spell which manipulates the water underneath the earth, causing the massive underground lakes to swell, sending water cascading through mazes of tunnels just below the surface. This in turn could create giant sinkholes which could drastically alter the make-up of any given battlefield.</div> </div> </div> </div>Isn't there a spell that already does this? One that summons a waterspout. And another that creates a Tsunami","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-08T08:01:47-07:00","id":1216648,"title":"","content":"You got me. I was just trying to come up with some idea. There very well might be something which does this, or at least does something similar.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Co-Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.twitter.com/deliberativepod\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a>!<br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/thedeliberativepodcast\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook</a>!<br /> Follow us on the <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com\" target=\"_blank\">Web</a>!<br /> Like what we do? Support us on <a href=\"http://patreon.com/thedeliberative\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4164-lukkychukky","name":"Lukkychukky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-08T08:44:42-07:00","id":1216678,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lukkychukky</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1216598-celestial-and-solar-circle-spells-for-strategic-maneuvers?p=1216648#post1216648\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You got me. I was just trying to come up with some idea. There very well might be something which does this, or at least does something similar.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wasn't there a spell that basically the destruction of Jericho?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-08T11:54:47-07:00","id":1216758,"title":"","content":"Once again, ya got me bud. Hahaha! I don\u2019t know a ton about Exalted. Just spit-ballin\u2019 here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Co-Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.twitter.com/deliberativepod\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a>!<br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/thedeliberativepodcast\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook</a>!<br /> Follow us on the <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com\" target=\"_blank\">Web</a>!<br /> Like what we do? Support us on <a href=\"http://patreon.com/thedeliberative\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4164-lukkychukky","name":"Lukkychukky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-09T04:03:27-07:00","id":1216944,"title":"","content":"I would assume there are a number of categories spells form fall into when your talking about using them for battles and or wars. I'm not talking specific spells here, but just things that could be done (in my view at least) <br /> <br /> 1.) Landscape Alteration. These are the spells that change the landscape whether its bringing in water and turning the land into mud, making tree's grow in days instead of weeks so you can have cover, bringing up barricades, changing the height of the land. These would primarily be done PRIOR to battle when your preparing the land around your city for attack for instance rather than be done during the battle...that said, if you had a spell to just drop torrents of water over your oponents as they are charging and turning the ground to mud...that can be pretty useful. <br /> <br /> 2.) Misdirection and Information Gathering spells. These are spells that are designed to misdirect your enemy or gather information. These spells could be as simple as summoning a lot of mist to make sure your opponent's scouts can't find your army, or it could allow you to see through a birds eyes to see how your enemy has set up his army. Again, this is mostly done before battle, that said, being able to see that unit of archers that your opponent has hidden in the woods, or keep the enemy from noticing your own reserve force moving quietly through some trees ready to charge the enemies back line can be quite useful. <br /> <br /> 3) Artillery spells. These are spells usually used on the spot to well take out your opponents forces. These spells are usually cast during battle. <br /> <br /> 4) Summoning Spells: Spells that summon Demons/Elemental/The dead, usually to assist your preparation or your army in battle in some way. Whether your summon a demon to build your fortifications or you summon a blood ape to be one of your elite forces to shatter the enemies line, these spells can be used both before and during the battle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11535-furoan","name":"Furoan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-09T04:53:36-07:00","id":1216949,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11535-furoan\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"11535\" data-vbnamecard=\"11535\">Furoan</a> That's a really good break-down of it, I think. Very well thought out response. Thank you!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Co-Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.twitter.com/deliberativepod\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a>!<br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/thedeliberativepodcast\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook</a>!<br /> Follow us on the <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com\" target=\"_blank\">Web</a>!<br /> Like what we do? Support us on <a href=\"http://patreon.com/thedeliberative\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4164-lukkychukky","name":"Lukkychukky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-11T23:31:29-07:00","id":1226700,"title":"","content":"Huh. Don't demons make very good assassins? What with the dematerialization and super strength?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-12T01:37:14-07:00","id":1226710,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Furoan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1216598-celestial-and-solar-circle-spells-for-strategic-maneuvers?p=1216944#post1216944\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">4) Summoning Spells: Spells that summon Demons/Elemental/The dead, usually to assist your preparation or your army in battle in some way. Whether your summon a demon to build your fortifications or you summon a blood ape to be one of your elite forces to shatter the enemies line, these spells can be used both before and during the battle.</div> </div> </div> </div>Marrottes (the Hopping Puppeteers) are perfect for quickly building fortifications, especially if you've summoned a number of them, presuming you can keep them on-task. There's a conversion to 3e here, by Leetsepeak : <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/922863-demons-of-malfeas-3e-demon-conversions\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...on-conversions</a> It's not Solar or Celestial sorcery, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":10397,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","user":"ajf115","date":". 06-12-2018, 04:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-12T22:12:58-07:00","id":1227048,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1216598-celestial-and-solar-circle-spells-for-strategic-maneuvers?p=1226700#post1226700\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Huh. Don't demons make very good assassins? What with the dematerialization and super strength?</div> </div> </div> </div>Speaking from experience: very yes. Even more so than that, the ability to summon a fresh one every night all but guarantees victory in any battle of attrition.<br /> <br /> Of course, since this thread is about Celestial and Solar Circle we should be looking at second and third circle demons, the latter of which especially are often quite capable of crushing armies on their own.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-13T00:16:21-07:00","id":1227066,"title":"","content":"Heh. Even better yet. Get elementals. <br /> <br /> Summon a fire elemental. Get it to dematerialize.<br /> <br /> Tell it to materialize in an enemy stronghold or food store.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-13T05:10:48-07:00","id":1227110,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1216598-celestial-and-solar-circle-spells-for-strategic-maneuvers?p=1227066#post1227066\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Heh. Even better yet. Get elementals. <br /> <br /> Summon a fire elemental. Get it to dematerialize.<br /> <br /> Tell it to materialize in an enemy stronghold or food store.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not <i>every</i> fire elemental is literally a walking inferno. Ifrits, for instance, are radiant beefcakes who live to generate gratitude in others. Him <i>standing there</i> isn't going to light anything ablaze, except onlookers' hearts.<br /> <br /> Also, elementals aren't all capable of dematerializing anymore.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-13T08:02:53-07:00","id":1227142,"title":"","content":"When your plan is to set things on fire it goes without saying that you\u2019re going to summon one of the elementals that <i>can</i> do that, and if you can pass the binding roll in the first place then you probably have enough Occult to know which is which.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-13T08:50:50-07:00","id":1227149,"title":"","content":"I'll point out that summon elemental is only a terrestrial circle spell and has no celestial or solar circle variants published. Plus as Alucard mentioned, they mostly can't dematerialize. And the highest essence you can summon is 3 so it's unlikely they'd be able to.<br /> <br /> I think your best bet would be to summon a blood ape and drop him into the food stores or a barracks at night.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my homebrew exalt: The Fabulists - Chosen of the Raksha <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141861-peach-new-exalt-splat-the-fabulist-exalts-chosen-of-the-raksha\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8804-armyofwhispers","name":"armyofwhispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"790"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-13T08:54:30-07:00","id":1227152,"title":"","content":"Better yet. Metody. <br /> <br /> Let's see recently-awakened soldiers dodge the acid-puddles.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-18T09:35:02-07:00","id":1228316,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1216598-celestial-and-solar-circle-spells-for-strategic-maneuvers?p=1227110#post1227110\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not <i>every</i> fire elemental is literally a walking inferno. Ifrits, for instance, are radiant beefcakes who live to generate gratitude in others. Him <i>standing there</i> isn't going to light anything ablaze, except onlookers' hearts.<br /> <br /> Also, elementals aren't all capable of dematerializing anymore.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, where do we get a rough idea of which ones can or cannot?<br /> Be walking infernos, dematerialize or i ideally, both.<br /> <br /> Also, an idea of how far can Essence 1-3 elementals go in the fiery destruction department would be nice too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-18T14:44:17-07:00","id":1228384,"title":"","content":"I'd imagine &quot;somewhat less far than a Garda bird&quot; would be a good benchmark.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}